---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/layout/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for HomeGeneratorGuide: analytics, cookies, advertising including Google AdSense, affiliate links, and contact.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold text-[#1e3a5f]">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: 2026-10-03. This is a plain-language policy, not legal advice.</p>
    <div class="prose-hgg mt-6">
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact messages:</strong> if you email us, we receive your address and message content to respond.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics (when enabled):</strong> Google Analytics 4 may collect aggregated, anonymized usage data (pages viewed, device type, approximate region). No account or login data is collected — the site has no accounts.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Cookies & advertising</h2>
      <p>Google AdSense (when activated) and other third-party vendors use cookies, web beacons, IP addresses, or similar identifiers to serve and measure ads, including personalized advertising where permitted. Third parties may place and read cookies on your browser or use web beacons to collect information as a result of ad serving on this site.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You can opt out of personalized advertising via <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a> and <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info choices</a>.</li>
        <li>We never send personally identifiable information to Google in ad requests and do not use Google services to identify you.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>If affiliate links are activated, clicking them may set third-party (e.g., Amazon) cookies to attribute qualifying purchases. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>Static hosting (e.g., Netlify/Vercel) processes standard server logs to deliver pages. We run no databases and no user accounts.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Block or delete cookies in your browser settings (site remains readable).</li>
        <li>Contact us to request correction or deletion of a message you sent.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Content targets adult homeowners. We do not knowingly collect children's data and do not use interest-based targeting for children.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions: see our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
